'''Pawmi''' (Japanese: '''パモ''' ''Pamo'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

