==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Pawmi|74}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pawmi}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Pawmi|74}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*'''Random Spark''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon|Magnemite|62}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

